OL,3,ABad Girls star Helen Fraser dies aged  
OL,4,A84                                     
OL,6,FBritish television, theatre and film   
OL,7,Fstar Helen Fraser, who was perhaps best
OL,8,Fknown for her role in the hit prison   
OL,9,Fdrama Bad Girls, has died.             
OL,11,FThe actress, who also appeared in      
OL,12,Fepisodes of Coronation Street and The  
OL,13,FRoyle Family, reportedly died on 10    
OL,14,FNovember at Yaxley House Care Home, in 
OL,15,FEye, Suffolk. She was 84.              
OL,17,FBorn in Oldham, Greater Manchester, she
OL,18,Fhad lived in Wickham Skeith, in        
OL,19,FSuffolk, with her late husband Peter   
OL,20,FHandford.                              
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
